RAISE CORPSE

Exclusive to Necromancers.

Usage: raise corpse [id] or rc [id]

Mana cost: 8 on successful raising.
Cooldown: 120 seconds.

The revival chance depends on your level and corpse level.
Each eligible corpse permits one revival attempt.
A failed revival leaves the ordinary corpse loot available.

Successful raises have a 5 percent unique chance.
Unique undead have doubled attributes, HP and MP,
subject to native attribute limits.

Raised undead capacity:
  Level 1:   3       Level 34:  8
  Level 7:   4       Level 40:  9
  Level 14:  5       Level 47: 10
  Level 20:  6       Level 54: 11
  Level 27:  7       Level 60: 12

Their kills award experience to the owner.
Raised undead receive no pet experience.

Death, dismissal, logout or restart ends the summon.

See HELP PETS and HELP CORPSE.
